 "doc": "M4-C13-02 greybox (tools/act1/ch13_greybox.py; do not edit by hand): the Sanctum of the Level, the Glimmer temple. The vestibule (Gate), then the nave round the basin, a perfect mirror that has not stirred in four hundred years, lit from beneath by a light that never moves (Basin; a kneeling ledge rings it: nobody walks on it), Ethren's place at its head (ethren) and Corran's (corran). Kerrid never comes in. Back to the city at to_city. The story waits on the beat sheet (M4-C13-01).",
